flowchart TD
    User[Human requests assistance]
    Policy[Project and organization policy]
    Context[Retrieve bounded model context]
    Provider[Optional provider]
    Proposal[Structured uncommitted change set]
    Validate[Schema, model, security, and provenance validation]
    Review[Human inspect, edit, select, or reject]
    Commit[Ordinary authorized change-set commit]
    Audit[Audit and evaluation]

    User --> Policy
    Policy -->|allowed| Context
    Policy -->|denied| User
    Context --> Provider
    Provider --> Proposal
    Proposal --> Validate
    Validate --> Review
    Review -->|accept selected operations| Commit
    Review -->|reject| Audit
    Commit --> Audit
